    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin is using the official SASS brush from <a href=\"https://github.com/alexgorbatchev/syntaxhighlighter\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Alex Gorbatchev</a>.</p>\n<p>A list of all of my plugins can be found on the <a href=\"http://kau-boys.com/wordpress-plugins\" title=\"WordPress Plugins\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WordPress Plugin page</a> on my blog <a href=\"http://kau-boys.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">kau-boys.com</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ul>\n<li>Installation of the plugin itself work as always: https://codex.wordpress.org/Managing_Plugins#Installing_Plugins</li>\n<li>This plugin is only an extension of the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/syntaxhighlighter/\" rel=\"ugc\">SyntaxHighlighter Evolved</a> which has to be installed and activated</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20do%20i%20report%20security%20bugs%20found%20in%20this%20plugin%3F'>\nWhere do I report security bugs found in this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please report security bugs found in the source code of the &#8220;SyntaxHighlighter Evolved: SASS Brush&#8221; plugin through the <a href=\"https://patchstack.com/database/vdp/5ebbfb4b-cfff-4e73-aa6d-58fccbbf4428\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Patchstack Vulnerability Disclosure  Program</a>. The Patchstack team will assist you with verification, CVE assignment, and notify the developers of this plugin.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h3>1.3</h3>\n<p>Update keywords for the brush</p>\n<h3>1.2</h3>\n<p>Load the script in the footer of the page</p>\n<h3>1.1</h3>\n<p>Adding names for the Gutenberg block</p>\n<h3>1.0</h3>\n<p>First stable version</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Adds support for the SASS language to the SyntaxHighlighter Evolved plugin.",
